a) Write a Python program to Detect Duplicate Email Addresses
 A company imports customer email addresses from a database. Write a      function that identifies whether duplicate emails exist.  

ANSWER

def check_duplicate(emails):
    if len(emails) != len(set(emails)):
        return True
    return False

emails = ["a@gmail.com", "b@gmail.com", "a@gmail.com"]

print(check_duplicate(emails))
