(C) Write a Python program to perform set operations on the customer lists of two company branches and display:
1.	Customers common to both Branch A and Branch B. 
2.	Customers present only in Branch A. 
3.	Customers present only in Branch B. 
4.	All unique customers from both branches. 
Use appropriate Python set operations such as union, intersection, and difference.

ANSWERS

A = {101, 102, 103, 104}
B = {103, 104, 105, 106}

print("Common:", A.intersection(B))
print("Only Branch A:", A.difference(B))
print("Only Branch B:", B.difference(A))
print("All customers:", A.union(B))
