(b) Write a Python program to create a function check_eligibility ()   to determine whether a student is eligible to appear for an examination. The student will be eligible only if all the following conditions are satisfied:
•   Attendance must be at least 75%. 
•   Assignment must be submitted. 
•   Student must have paid the examination fee. 
•   Student must have completed the required practical work. 
•   Student must have cleared all previous dues.
The function should return a Boolean value (True or False) indicating whether the student is eligible for the examination.
Use: Functions, Boolean 

ANSWERS

def check_eligibility(attendance, assignment, fee, practical, dues):
    return (attendance >= 75 and assignment == True
            and fee == True and practical == True
            and dues == True)

print(check_eligibility(80, True, True, True, True))
print(check_eligibility(60, True, True, True, True))


